[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32100100_03_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32100100_03_0010","text":"鱿鱼烧，四个\n……啊，还有请给我筷子"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32100100_03_0020","text":"…………你知道吗？\n鱿鱼啊──"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32100100_03_0030","text":"……以前是外星人嘛"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32100100_03_0040","text":"诶"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32100100_03_0050","text":"你每次吃都说一遍，我耳朵都快听出茧子了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32100100_03_0060","text":"章鱼？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32100100_03_0070","text":"鱿鱼，怎么会是章鱼……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32100100_03_0080","text":"诶～～～\n圆香前辈的冷笑话一点都不好笑～～！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32100100_03_0090","text":"…………\n不是冷笑话……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_32100100_03_0100","text":"啊——……"}]
